          "title": "Tens, then ones",
          "body": "83 − 47: take away the tens first, 83 − 40 = 43, then the ones, 43 − 7 = 36."
        },
        {
          "title": "Worked example",
          "example": {"template": "add-subtract.take-two-digit", "params": {"a": 83, "b": 47}, "format": "difference"}
        },
        {
          "title": "Count up when they are close",
